  "notes": [
    "Reflexive -AR verb with o→ue stem change. The stem vowel o changes to ue in all present tense forms except nosotros (me suelto, te sueltas, se suelta, se sueltan). Nosotros is regular (nos soltamos).",
    "No stem change in preterite, imperfect, future, or conditional.",
    "Regular past participle: *soltado*",
    "Base verb: *soltar* (to release/let go of something — transitive). *Soltarse* = to let go, to come undone, to break free.",
    "*¡No te sueltes!* (Don't let go!)",
    "*Se soltó el pelo.* (She let her hair down / her hair came loose.)",
    "*El perro se soltó de la correa.* (The dog got free from the lead.)",
    "Related: *soltar* (to release, to let go of), *suelto/a* (loose, free), *la suelta* (release)"
  ],
